spoilers about getting Excalibur follow

I once played a Valkyrie (sp?) at storm.tamu.edu.  I like V's, because,
among other things, they start with a long sword.  This saves me time
from having to find one when I become 5th level to #dip to get 
Excalibur.  So, when I reached 5th level, I #dipped my sword in a fountain
and it *rusted*!  This has never happened in the version (also 3.0j) that
has been installed on the Sparc2 on which I normally play.  This is
somewhat annoying.  I mean, one of the great things about getting Excalibur
this way is that it is rustproof.  Rustproofing my sword before I #dip
it effectively removes this bonus from Excalibur (i.e,, though Excalibur
would still be rustproof if I rustproofed my sword before #dipping it,
the rustproofness of the sword is not due to the way I obtained it, or
something like that :) ).  Has anyone else had this happen at storm, or
anywhere else for that matter?  Is there a way around this, other than
rustproofing one's sword before hand (or changing the code)?
